OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be mostly cloudy with
OL,6,Fsome bright intervals and a few
OL,7,Fshowers in the west. The east will be
OL,8,Fdry with longer bright or sunny
OL,9,Fspells. Light winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FMostly cloudy in west with
OL,12,Fshowers easing in the evening, dry
OL,13,Fovernight, before showers return
OL,14,Ftowards dawn. Dry in the east with
OL,15,Fclear spells. Less cold than previous
OL,16,Fnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
FL,190,160,301,260,100,100
