OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FSome sunny spells earlier in
OL,6,Fthe morning before turning cloudier
OL,7,Fwith showers over Dumfries and
OL,8,FBorders. Cloudy in the afternoon with
OL,9,Fshowers continuing and spreading north
OL,10,Finto Lothian.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FWindy
OL,13,Fon Sunday with rain, turning wintry
OL,14,Fover the hills, and to lower levels at
OL,15,Ftimes. Showers spreading south Monday,
OL,16,Fwintry over hills. Sunny spells and
OL,17,Flargely dry on Tuesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
